You are designing a system that processes event logs generated by two sensors in a factory. Based on the given test cases, identify the policy used to process and combine these logs.

The system receives two lists of integer event IDs from two sensors. Some event IDs may appear multiple times across both sensors.

The processing policy is:

Combine the event logs from both sensors.
Remove duplicate event IDs.
Sort the final list in ascending order.
Return the processed event log.
